OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold, bright start across the
OL,6,Fregion. Cloud builds at times through
OL,7,Fthe day but remaining dry with good
OL,8,Fsunny spells. Feeling warm in the sun
OL,9,Fby mid afternoon. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FFine and partly cloudy
OL,12,Finitially. Clear spells linger
OL,13,Fovernight leading to mist and fog in
OL,14,Fprone spots and areas of low cloud
OL,15,Fdeveloping by dawn. Milder than last
OL,16,Fnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
